{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, breezy summer fashion inspired by frontier living!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This set includes rustic-style outfits and hats to help you beat the heat while looking great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Matsuri and Kagari on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working the land or relaxing in town, dress the part!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbOutfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneer Summer Outfit, Summer Pioneer Kid's Wear, Pioneer Summer Outfit: Aqua, Summer Pioneer Kid's Wear: Aqua, Pioneer Summer Outfit: Berry, Summer Pioneer Kid's Wear: Berry, Pioneer Summer Outfit: Citrus, Summer Pioneer Kid's Wear: Citrus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbEquipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flower Hat: White, Small Flower Hat: White, Round Straw Hat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828650?t=1754444246","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828650?t=1754444246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828650/8a3ea5b7d329e87d6096db69efc6866e7e6a15b3/caps